									<p>The State of Idaho is committed to providing an inclusive and accessible experience across our many different websites and web applications. Through prioritizing accessibility, we continually improve the user experience for everyone, regardless of an individual’s ability. We design our web pages to meet federal law and the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1, level AA criteria.<br /><br />If the format of any material prevents your ability to access the information, please contact us for assistance at AdminRules@dfm.idaho.gov.</p>								</div>
